1. Added | Exception-handling structure
   Wrapped the existing `operator.inv(_values_from_object(self))` call and return logic in a `try-except` structure, and added an empty-size check and exception re-raising in the exception branch.
   This includes:
   * `try` block: execute `operator.inv(_values_from_object(self))` and return the wrapped result;
   * `except` block: return `self` when `not np.prod(self.shape)`; otherwise, execute `raise`.
